  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market.<lb/>
               This Evening, Wednesday, <date when="1811-10-09">October 9, 1811</date><lb/>
               Will be perform'd the Musical Piece call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main">The <hi rend="allcaps">Review</hi>;</title><lb/>
               <title type="sub">Or, The Wags of Windsor.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Mr. Deputy Bull,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Captain Beaugard,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Caleb Quotem,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Harwood</hi>,</actor><lb/>
                  (being his first appearance on this Stage.)</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Looney Mactwolter,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Charles Williams,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>John Lump,</role> (1st time,) <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Russell</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Dubbs,</role> <actor>Mr. Minton.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Serjeant,</role> <actor>Mr. Lewes.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Grace Gaylove,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lucy,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Garrick</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Phoebe Whitethorn,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Martha,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Kendall</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Chorus of Soldiers, and Peasants, &amp;c.</role> Messrs. <actor>Hodson,</actor> <actor>Widdicombe,</actor> <actor>Eames,</actor> <actor>Odwell,</actor> &amp;c,</castItem>
               </castList>
               After which (<hi rend="allcaps">13th Time</hi>) <hi rend="allcaps">A New Farce</hi>, in Two Acts, call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title><quote>"Darkness Visible."</quote></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Russell</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Munden</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added (<hi rend="allcaps">9th Time</hi>) <hi rend="allcaps">A Melo Drame</hi>, call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main">Travellers Benighted;</title><lb/>
                  <title type="sub">Or, The Forest of Rosenwald.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With New Scenery, Dresses, and Decorations.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Don Felix,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Baron Lindenberg,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Raymond,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Theodore,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Russell</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Baptiste,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Claude ,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Jaques,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Marco,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/> 
                  <castItem><role>Robert,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Agnes,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Beatrice,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Ursula,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Bleeding Nun,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Kendall</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Annette,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Marguerette,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/> 
               </castList>
               The Doors to be Open'd at <time when="17:30:00">Half past Five o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin<lb/>
               at <time when="18:30:00">Half past Six</time>, precisely, for the remainder of the Season.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">First Price. Second Price.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi>,---<measure type="currency">Six Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">Three Shillings</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi>,---<measure type="currency">Three Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">One Shilling and Sixpence</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi>, <measure type="currency">Two Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">One Shilling</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Upper Gallery</hi>, <measure type="currency">One Shilling</measure>. - <measure type="currency">Sixpence</measure>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi> at the Theatre.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
</TEI>
